# Pairs with ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeleted in ReplicationReBootstrap. The foreign reconcile is sound only below
# the low watermark the source held at export open: above it the source may not have
# applied the entry, so its absence proves nothing.
MODULE: ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeletedForeignAboveWatermark
TARGET: ReconcileDeletesOnlyDeleted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an entry of another origin is reconciled whatever its HLC, so one the source never applied is turned into a delete
PERTURBS: EndExport

--- FIND
           okFor == foreign /\ stable /\ reg[r].h < ex.lwm0
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the watermark is not consulted.
           okFor == foreign /\ stable
--- END
